/Title (Memoisation stores the answer for each input value. When the same subproblem is needed again, its stored result is returned instead of recalculating it. Time complexity is O\(n\) additions and the cache uses O\(n\) entries. The recursive version still uses O\(n\) call-stack depth and can exceed Python's recursion limit for sufficiently large n.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1047 0 R
>>
